flowchart TD
    A[POST /api/config/analyze] --> B[Select Parser for SDK]
    B --> C[Parse config code]
    C --> D[First Pass: Dictionary Lookup]

    D --> E{Option in<br/>JSON Dictionary?}

    E -->|Yes| F["✅ recognized=true<br/>source='dictionary'<br/>Rich metadata: SE guidance,<br/>warnings, examples"]
    E -->|No| G[Collect as Unknown]

    G --> H{Any unknowns<br/>AND introspectFn<br/>provided?}

    H -->|No| I["⚠️ recognized=false<br/>Unknown option warning"]
    H -->|Yes| J["Second Pass:<br/>Fetch /introspect from<br/>SDK container (once)"]

    J --> K{Introspection<br/>succeeded?}

    K -->|No - graceful degradation| I
    K -->|Yes| L{Option in<br/>introspection<br/>response?}

    L -->|Yes| M["✅ recognized=true<br/>source='introspection'<br/>Info: not yet in dictionary"]
    L -->|No| I

    F --> N[Check missing required options]
    M --> N
    I --> N

    N --> O[Generate recommendations]
    O --> P[Calculate health score 0-100]
    P --> Q[Return AnalysisResult]

    style F fill:#c8e6c9,stroke:#388e3c
    style M fill:#fff9c4,stroke:#f9a825
    style I fill:#ffcdd2,stroke:#d32f2f
    style J fill:#bbdefb,stroke:#1976d2
